@startuml
title Session billing, payment recovery and separate close
actor "SERVICE_STAFF" as Staff
actor Customer
participant "CustomerBillingService" as CustomerBilling
participant "Billing UI" as UI
participant "BillingPreviewService" as Billing
participant "BillingContextProvider" as Context
participant "BillingEngine" as Engine
participant "PaymentService" as Payment
participant "DiningSessionService" as Session
database DB
Customer -> CustomerBilling : POST dining-sessions/{id}/bill-request\nHttpOnly customer cookie + allowed Origin
CustomerBilling -> DB : lock ACTIVE session / set bill_requested_at once
note over CustomerBilling,DB : Same row lock as Order/close.\nLater Orders return 409; existing orders continue.
CustomerBilling -> Context : trusted opening snapshot / counts
CustomerBilling -> Engine : calculate(context)
CustomerBilling --> Customer : REQUESTED + BillSummary
Customer -> CustomerBilling : GET bill-status (poll 5 seconds while visible)
CustomerBilling --> Customer : REQUESTED / PAID + backend amount
Staff -> UI : select session
UI -> Billing : POST billing/preview {sessionId}
Billing -> Billing : require SERVICE_STAFF
Billing -> Context : findBySessionId(sessionId)
Context -> DB : read opening price snapshot / counts / status
Context --> Billing : internal BillingContext
Billing -> Engine : calculate(context)
Engine --> Billing : internal BillCalculation
Billing --> UI : BillSummary display breakdown
UI -> Payment : GET payments/sessions/{sessionId}
Payment -> DB : find recorded payment
Payment --> UI : PaymentResult including recorded amount / 404
Staff -> UI : confirm payment method
UI -> Payment : POST payments {sessionId, paymentMethod}
Payment -> Payment : require SERVICE_STAFF
Payment -> Context : trusted context
Payment -> Engine : calculate(context)
Engine --> Payment : payable total
Payment -> DB : insert PAID / paidAt (unique session_id)
Payment --> UI : 201 PaymentResult with recorded amount
note over Payment,Session : Payment does not close the session
alt response lost
 Staff -> UI : check status manually
 UI -> Payment : GET payments/sessions/{sessionId}
 Payment --> UI : recorded result / 404 / error
 note over UI
  Only confirmed 404 unlocks manual retry.
  No automatic POST retry; existing result blocks payment.
 end note
end
Staff -> Session : POST dining-sessions/{id}/close
Session -> Session : require SERVICE_STAFF / ACTIVE
Session -> Payment : PaymentStatusLookup(sessionId)
Payment -> DB : read status
Payment --> Session : same sessionId + PAID
Session -> DB : complete session / return table AVAILABLE atomically
Session --> Staff : completed
@enduml
